WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.411 --> 00:00:03.561
Unit fifteen. HIV and STI Awareness!

2
00:00:04.475 --> 00:00:08.158
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:11.348
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.399 --> 00:00:15.333
Today we learn about HIV and STI Awareness. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.400
HIV. Say it with me. HIV!

6
00:00:23.912 --> 00:00:27.362
STI. Say it with me. STI!

7
00:00:30.781 --> 00:00:34.364
Transmission. Say it with me. Transmission!

8
00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.086
Testing. Say it with me. Testing!

9
00:00:44.537 --> 00:00:47.587
Condom. Say it with me. Condom!

10
00:00:51.069 --> 00:00:53.802
Treatment. Say it with me. Treatment!

11
00:00:57.310 --> 00:01:00.576
Stigma. Say it with me. Stigma!

12
00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:07.502
Prevention. Say it with me. Prevention!

13
00:01:11.076 --> 00:01:24.138
HIV and other STIs spread through certain body fluids, mainly during unprotected sex, and HIV also through shared needles. Condoms and testing are key prevention. HIV treatment lets people live long, healthy lives, and stigma should end.

14
00:01:24.188 --> 00:01:27.019
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:28.481 --> 00:01:33.485
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:33.535 --> 00:01:34.685
Transmission!

17
00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:40.852
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.902 --> 00:01:42.000
Stigma!

19
00:01:42.695 --> 00:01:47.669
Did you know? HIV cannot spread through hugging, sharing food or using the same toilet!

20
00:01:47.719 --> 00:01:49.737
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.251 --> 00:01:59.066
Think and answer. Why is stigma harmful for HIV prevention?

22
00:01:59.116 --> 00:02:00.266
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.363 --> 00:02:05.880
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:08.535
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

